{"type":"text","timestamp":1786610070800,"sessionID":"ses_005be182dffeqsiK0ybzYnt6OK","part":{"id":"prt_ffa422666001aORJdg3y2Ycly2","messageID":"msg_ffa42171a001T83zRltQv3OrFM","sessionID":"ses_005be182dffeqsiK0ybzYnt6OK","type":"text","text":"The repository is only a legacy Flask/SQLite seed, so I’ll replace it rather than preserve incompatible database-backed behavior. The implementation will use one `websockets` listener for WebSocket traffic and `/health`, with lock-protected in-memory connections plus atomically persisted client state and append-only JSONL history.","time":{"start":1786610067046,"end":1786610070789},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0c0a4936d53b8cc6016a7d8192fbfc8191b14300ff38c7b5c6","phase":"commentary"}}}}
